1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,840
Now, there are two bodies, one moving, one scene.

2
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:13,320
Which one are you?

3
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:16,560
Can you be in both?

4
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:22,000
If you choose one, what happens to the other?

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:30,320
Is either one more you or are both simply appearances?

6
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:33,640
Look at your right arm.

7
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:40,040
Please raise your right hand and notice how your body moves.

8
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:47,960
Please place your right hand on your left shoulder.

9
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:54,200
Please raise your left hand and notice how your body moves.

10
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:58,840
Please place your left hand on your right shoulder.

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:06,080
Now place both hands on your lap.

12
00:01:06,080 --> 00:01:08,560
Which one is yours?

13
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:11,440
Can you be in both?

14
00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:14,040
You don't need to answer.

15
00:01:14,040 --> 00:01:21,720
Just notice that awareness can see two bodies without needing either one to be a fixed self.

16
00:01:21,720 --> 00:01:22,840
Now just observe.

